{"3503690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dark Omen", "steam_appid": 3503690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/1aff902e180089b6d8fa186d0a8c5f39.webp?t=1785787503\" width=616 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/dc1dde7e39a996fd72dcdbabdb3866e2.avif?t=1785787503\" width=616 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/1aff902e180089b6d8fa186d0a8c5f39.webp?t=1785787503\" width=616 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Realms</strong> have been ravaged by the <strong>Architect's</strong> foul vision and encroaching darkness. Your job? Drive it back, clean up the mess, and secure a brighter future for your village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash and blast your way through hordes of <strong>randomly affixed enemies</strong>, topple <strong>elite bosses</strong> with unique, deadly mechanics, and bathe in glorious loot-splosions as you chase the next  rare drop. With over <strong>100 unique items</strong> and limited slots, you'll have to make hard choices about what to keep and what to leave behind. Only then can you craft that perfect, game-breaking build and finally turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when you inevitably bite the dust? Don't sweat it. Each death is just another step toward revealing mystical <strong>Omens </strong>that permanently augment your abilities and alter the battlefield, so you can come back swinging even harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/ddca5b778aa9c9f1f7fddfe169f6fbc3.webp?t=1785787503\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/ddca5b778aa9c9f1f7fddfe169f6fbc3.poster.avif?t=1785787503\" class=\"bb_img\" width=271 height=16 /></picture></span> and dive headfirst into the madness. <strong>The Void</strong> is tough, but it hasn't met <strong><i>you</i></strong> yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/557ec7bb41c7411b4443f26b56d3bc5e.avif?t=1785787503\" width=616 height=67 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/87f4dd1027c0b3bd44635480d829c424.poster.avif?t=1785787503\" width=778 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/87f4dd1027c0b3bd44635480d829c424.webm?t=1785787503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/87f4dd1027c0b3bd44635480d829c424.mp4?t=1785787503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Realms are flooded with enemies here to challenge you. Thanks to <strong>randomized enemy &amp; level affixes</strong>, no two fights feel the same. Master the chaos, dodge every projectile, and send those minions back where they came from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/522bcf546066ba32b3e72a5abff8249a.webp?t=1785787503\" width=616 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/f262a9b2c83eccf003ed457dff0eda92.avif?t=1785787503\" width=1170 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who doesn't love a good loot-splosion? Snag <strong>over 100 unique items</strong>, from measly common gear all the way to ancient <strong>relic </strong>and <strong>mythic gear</strong>. Mix and match for wild <strong>ability interactions</strong> that turn a lucky drop into a screen-clearing masterpiece. Your dream build could be just one boss-kill away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/965fa08dbf6b2ed112cfd4c2be84d53d.webp?t=1785787503\" width=616 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/c15795b2d831596e48c17fd0276ea36d.avif?t=1785787503\" width=1170 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good gear can always be better. Let the <strong>Blacksmith</strong> forge your items into something far deadlier, or take a &quot;calculated&quot; risk with the <strong>Cultist</strong> to corrupt your equipment for unpredictable, game-breaking power. Your gear, your rules—just don't blame us if the Cultist gets weird.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/42f987b76173afba38c4215af09ae63d.webp?t=1785787503\" width=616 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/66d6003572363174cf1276795fb97216.avif?t=1785787503\" width=1170 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Void is tough, but you are definitely tougher. Scour the realms for every advantage to prepare for the ultimate <strong>end-game showdowns</strong>. Optimize your build, gather your wits, pray for drops, and show those bosses who's the real boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/ac2d06e3b2fb63215fc68fcd4933a100.webp?t=1785787503\" width=616 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/8360fa996d30fa72115a61c221c82056.avif?t=1785787503\" width=1170 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look, everybody dies — it’s practically a tradition here. Dust yourself off, gain <strong>favour</strong> with the villagers, and complete challenges to obtain powerful <strong>Omens</strong> — ancient stones placed on the Omen Tablet that unlock new powers, alter the very rules of the game, and grow stronger  the smarter you place them.<br><i>Death isn't a failure; it’s just a very dramatic way to gear up for round two.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/1aff902e180089b6d8fa186d0a8c5f39.webp?t=1785787503\" width=616 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>-- Fight, Perish &amp; Reclaim Your Future. --