787503\" width=616 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>-- Fight, Perish &amp; Reclaim Your Future. --</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/extras/1aff902e180089b6d8fa186d0a8c5f39.webp?t=1785787503\" width=616 height=16 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Push back the encroaching darkness and the Architect's foul designs, then return to rebuild your village and reunite its people. Forge powerful artifacts and arrange mystical Omens to shape your next build as you battle relentless hordes and bosses in this low-poly Action RPG Roguelite.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/ae91a9eb6e3cd168af11812e1255d317594436c7/header.jpg?t=1785787503", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/1ef3e3eeca89716b00b0056df138468b2cc6106d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785787503", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503690/1ef3e3eeca89716b00b0056df138468b2cc6106d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785787503", "website": "https://scarcegames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i7-7700 or AMD™ Ryzen 5 2500x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 960, Intel® Arc™ A380, or ATI Radeon™ RX 470<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating sy